{"id":265528,"name":"Hayate Residence 6 1BDR, New Cairo ","headline":"The 1BDR Posh Rooftop w/Outdoor Terrace @ New Cairo","summary":"This posh one bedroom apartment is perfect for couples & business travelers with an amazing rooftop.","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis stylish and comfortable apartment is designed for both short and extended stays.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find:\r\n✔️one bedrooms with a queen-size bed.\r\n✔️A full bathroom stocked with fresh face and body towels .\r\n✔️A spacious open-plan living room with modern touches.\r\n✔️A dining area for enjoying meals together.\r\n✔️A full equipped kitchen with a Nespresso machine, kettle, hot plate, microwave, and cooking utensils.\r\n✔️A 55-inch Smart TV with cable and streaming access.\r\n✔️Reliable Wi-Fi for work or entertainment.\r\n✔️Complimentary bottled water, and two coffee capsules.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nYou’ll have the entire place to yourself—no shared spaces, just your own slice of serenity.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\n✔️We’re available to assist you between 9:00 AM and 4:00 AM Cairo time.\r\n✔️Whether you have questions before arrival or need help during your stay, our team is happy to support you on via Airbnb messages throughout your experience.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n✔️Cairo Festival City Mall - considered to be the best mall in New Cairo,  is a 15 minute drive from the apartment.\r\n✔️Cairo International Airport is a 20 min drive.\r\n✔️Giza Pyramids is a 50 min drive\r\n✔️Downtown Cairo is a 30 min drive \r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Private Services: We offer convenient airport pickup, drop-off, and private guided tours across Cairo and Giza. Just message us to arrange in advance.\r\n✔️ Free of charge parking is available. \r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Smoking is only allowed outside the building (a fine of $100 will be imposed when smoking indoors).\r\n✔️ Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests will be granted entry. \r\n✔️ All guests must provide a valid ID f